The Prime Minister, Shri Narendra Modi, highlighted that the Central Reserve Police Force’s (CRPF) achievement of recording zero casualties in 12 consecutive months for the first time in 47 years, describing it as a zero that speaks volumes.
Shri Modi wrote on X;
“A ZERO that speaks volumes.
@crpfindia”
A ZERO that speaks volumes.

